 buy their own health insurance and are not enrolled in job-based coverage 
 or the Oregon Health Plan\nDetails: Added in the October 2026 discovery sw
 eep\; the database had no marketplace entry. The enrollment window is ente
 red as two same-year ranges because the calendar parser does not read a ra
 nge that crosses a year boundary.
URL:https://healthcare.oregon.gov/explorehealth/
CATEGORIES:Discount Programs
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
