DTSTAMP:20261025T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261102
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261109
SUMMARY:Oregon Zoo Discount Days & Income-Qualified Admission: Fall Discoun
 t Days
DESCRIPTION:Category: Discount Programs\nCost: $13 admission for everyone\n
 Info: Half of the regular $26 adult price. Cannot be combined with other d
 iscounts\, including membership. Infants 0-1 are free with a paid adult ti
 cket.\nAddress: Oregon Zoo\, 4001 SW Canyon Rd\, Portland\, OR 97221\nPhon
 e: 503-226-1561\nWebsite: https://www.oregonzoo.org/discounts\nDetails: St
 anding $13 income-qualified admission plus the annual Fall Discount Days w
 eek\, November 2-8\, 2026. Confirmed on oregonzoo.org's event page on 2026
 -10-25\; the page prints no year\, but November 2-8 is a Monday-to-Sunday 
 week listed beside the 2026 ZooLights dates.
LOCATION:Oregon Zoo\, 4001 SW Canyon Rd\, Portland\, OR 97221
URL:https://www.oregonzoo.org/discounts
CATEGORIES:Discount Programs
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR